        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "gu_sight_light_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chen Le, speaking earlier to Fang Yuan while he poses as Hei Cheng, describes the same killer move: once used, Zhou Min’s eyes shoot golden white light that can cut down anything, yet the farther the distance the stronger it is, and close up it is drastically weakened; right in front of her, even a mortal killer move can block it. Fang Yuan withstands the light under bloodstained conqueror’s robe and charges closer so the move’s power and his immortal essence expenditure fall.",
      "chapters": [
        1126
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
